<title>USA: CCC buys 3,000 T U.S. sunflower oil for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 3,000 T U.S. sunflower oil for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought last week 3,000 tonnes sunflower seed oil in bulk under its export program for donation to Mozambique.</p>
<p>The deal was done on May 9. The sunflower seed oil was purchased from ADM Bulk Oils at $560.60 a tonne, FOB, New Orleans. Shipment was slated for June 1-20.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
